NEUROLOGIC DISORDERS  
Participants may present with signs and symptoms of sensory and/or motor neuropathy.  
Diagnostic workup is essential for an accurate characterization to differentiate between 
alternative etiologies.  Management guidelines for neurologic disorders  are provided in 
Table  A6-11. 
  

